  "bodyHash": "f8523d2940e40dc6",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpeKQZQ.png\" alt=\"Supplementaries 模組\" width=\"1519\" height=\"855\"></a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;未定義</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[![Supplementaries Discord](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv</a>) [![在 Patreon 上支持我](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar</a>) [![Supplementaries Twitter](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbadges.penpow.dev%252fbadges%252fsocial%252ftwitter-plural%252fcozy.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez</a>) [![YouTube 頻道](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Supplementaries 是一款高度可配置的 Forge 模組，專注於添加補足原版遊戲空白的實用內容。其功能設計注重實用性、美觀性，並與現有內容完美互補，為你的「原版+」體驗提供多種嶄新的增強方式。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組需要 <strong>Moonlight Library</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雖然有支援，但由於此模組主要針對 Forge 開發，Fabric 版本可能會缺少部分次要功能</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以自由將此模組加入您的整合包中</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;以下語言已完成翻譯：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Deutsch | Polski | Fran&ccedil;ais | Русский | Italiano | English | Če&scaron;tina | 한국어 | Українська | Portugu&ecirc;s | Српски | Espa&ntilde;ol | Қазақ | Bahasa Melayu | Pirate Speech | 简体中文 (中国) | 繁體中文 (香港) | 繁體中文 (台灣) | T&uuml;rk&ccedil;e</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🖼️ 媒體 🖼️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">宣傳片：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZTN_DWP5d3o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在此查看一些評價</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>其他評價：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">製作模組花費了我大量時間，如果您喜歡我的作品並希望支持我，可以透過這裡進行贊助。贊助後您將獲得專屬的客製化 <strong>地球儀</strong> 和/或 <strong>雕像</strong>！若您使用折扣碼 \"supplementaries\" 從 Akliz 購買伺服器，同樣適用此獎勵。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？歡迎瀏覽 Akliz，他們提供專為模组版 Minecraft 打造的頂級品牌伺服器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有非常溫馨的社群、卓越的客服支援，伺服器表現也非常出色<br>使用代碼 \"supplementaries\" 可享<strong> 8 折優惠</strong>，同時也能支持到我！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❓ 常見問題 ❓</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何停用/調整 X 功能？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;請參考 <a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/Supplementaries/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>維基</strong></a> 中的「自訂設定」章節，或加入我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fqdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：能否更新/降級至 X 版本？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;我計畫未來會將模組移植至每個新的大型 Minecraft 版本，請耐心等待。<br>至於降級絕對不行，我沒有興趣支援過時的老版本。維護單一版本已經佔用我大量時間，且各版本間差異極大，若要支援舊版幾乎等於要重新學習如何製作模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：能否新增 X 功能/方塊？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 建議您加入我們的 Discord。我們設有專門的區塊用於收集此類建議。若我覺得您的構想足夠契合，未來新增的機會將非常高。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何使用 X 方塊/物品？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 請再次參考 <strong>維基</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：如何修復此問題/崩潰？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;請在 Issues（問題）區段開啟回報，務必附上 <strong>崩潰報告（Crash Report）。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>問：Fabric 版本缺少 X</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>Supplementaries 主要是一款 Forge 模組。若某些功能缺失，代表該功能無法簡單或輕易實作，因為 Fabric 缺乏 Forge API 提供的相對應組件，而該功能高度依賴這些組件。更多資訊請查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fJdipbyU.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;未定義</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 致謝名單 🏆</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">許多玩家為本模組貢獻了資源與貼圖，名單過於龐大無法在此一一列出。不過，若想直接在遊戲內查看，只需將一本命名為 \"credits\" 的書放入告示牌即可。</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，部分音效來源於 Zapsplat，特此致謝。<br><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"幽靈豐收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之靈\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"儲物標籤\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"極品模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡木樹\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vista\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1488/645/638967363014143781.gif\" alt=\"景觀模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"咩咩模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/997/638414771733478975.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"效果說明模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更優睡蓮葉\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/992/638414764957723804.png\" alt=\"進度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"隨機礦石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"安穩入睡\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"多色調模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"心石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"地圖圖集\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"通用鋸木機\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"修正模組\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
